{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/tekton-ollama-actions/ollama-generate","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:35.978Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/tekton-stepaction/tekton-ollama-actions/ollama-generate","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/tekton-stepaction/tekton-ollama-actions/ollama-generate"},"readme":"# Ollama Generate StepAction\n\nA reusable StepAction that encapsulates the logic to communicate with an Ollama server. It handles waiting for the server, pulling the specified model, and generating a text response.\n\n## Parameters\n\n- **model**: The name of the model (e.g., `tinyllama`).\n- **prompt**: The prompt to send.\n- **ollama-host**: The URL of the server (default: `http://localhost:11434`).\n\n## Results\n\n- **response**: The generated text.\n\n## Usage in a Task\n\n```yaml\nsteps:\n  - name: ask-ollama\n    ref:\n      name: ollama-generate\n    params:\n      - name: model\n        value: tinyllama\n      - name: prompt\n        value: \"Hello!\"\n      - name: ollama-host\n        value: \"http://localhost:11434\"\n```","readmeBase":"https://github.com/khrm/tekton-ai-actions/stepaction","publisher":{"name":"khrm","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?user=khrm","official":false,"verified":false,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-01-16T06:04:00.000Z","categories":["AI and machine learning"],"keywords":["tekton","stepaction","ai","llm","ollama","stepaction"],"license":null,"links":[{"name":"source","url":"https://github.com/khrm/tekton-ai-actions/blob/master/stepaction/ollama-generate/0.1/ollama-generate.yaml"},{"name":"Tekton Ollama Actions repository","url":"https://github.com/khrm/tekton-ai-actions/stepaction"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":0,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"0.1.0","digest":"sha256:21f1825106a62ba4fe48aa0d87c69cf0c8c77a87577907957d3ff12118aad849","pushed":"2026-01-16T06:0